# Frame_Card - the reward card: the panel's gold moulding and navy band around a sheet of parchment.
# 48x48, Tiled, border 16 on every side: 0..15 frame + parchment margin, 16..31 the centre tile.
# Light from the top-left, same frame build as Frame_Panel (half-round gold moulding, mitred navy band, gold corner
# blocks, inner gold fillet). The parchment lies below the frame: the frame casts a two-step shadow onto it along
# the top and left, and gold book corners hold the sheet down in its four corners.
size 48 48
key
  K #0a0c18  ink (outer line)
  H #fff4b8  gold highlight
  L #ffd65a  gold light
  G #e8a830  gold
  D #a8661a  gold shade
  X #5c360c  gold deep line / edge of the parchment sheet
  B #283867  navy band, lit faces
  N #1f2c56  navy band, shade faces
  E #111936  groove
  P #f2e2b4  parchment
  p #e6d29e  parchment, soft shadow
  q #d4b97e  parchment, cast shadow
strokes
  line K 3 0 44 0 47 3 47 44 44 47 3 47 0 44 0 3 3 0
  rect X 3 3 44 44
  rect E 7 7 40 40
  rect G 8 8 39 39
  rect X 9 9 38 38
seeds
  G 12 1
  B 12 5
  P 24 24
ops
  band G H 0 -1 1
  band G H -1 0 1
  poly =H L 48 0 48 48 0 48
  poly =G D 48 0 48 48 0 48
  poly =B N 48 0 48 48 0 48
  # the frame's shadow on the parchment: two steps along the top and the left only
  band P p 0 -1 2
  band P p -1 0 2
  band P q 0 -1 1
  band P q -1 0 1
shade at 4 4
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 41 4
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 4 41
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 41 41
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
# gold book corners on the parchment: a flat plate, the long edge catching the light where it faces up-left
# (bottom-right corner) and turning away from it where it faces down-right (top-left corner, which also drops a
# 1 px shadow onto the sheet); the other two long edges face across the light and stay plain
shade at 10 10
  GGGGD
  GGGDq
  GGDq.
  GDq..
  Dq...
shade at 33 10
  GGGGG
  .GGGG
  ..GGG
  ...GG
  ....G
shade at 10 33
  G....
  GG...
  GGG..
  GGGG.
  GGGGG
shade at 33 33
  ....H
  ...HG
  ..HGG
  .HGGG
  HGGGG
